\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 Clause 7: \uc0\u8005 \u964 \u945 \u957  \u948 \u8050  \u949 \u7988 \u960 \u8131  \u8005 \u964 \u953  \u928 \u940 \u957 \u964 \u945  \u8017 \u960 \u959 \u964 \u941 \u964 \u945 \u954 \u964 \u945 \u953 , \u948 \u8134 \u955 \u959 \u957  \u8005 \u964 \u953  \u7952 \u954 \u964 \u8056 \u962  \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u8017 \u960 \u959 \u964 \u940 \u958 \u945 \u957 \u964 \u959 \u962  \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u8183  \u964 \u8048  \u960 \u940 \u957 \u964 \u945  \'97 
\f3\i "But when He saith, All things are put under, it is manifest that He is excepted who put all things under Him"
\f0\i0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa346\partightenfactor0

\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf0 This is Paul's careful theological qualification \'97 and it is decisive.
\f2\b0 \
When Scripture says 
\f0\b "all things are subjected to Him"
\f2\b0 , Paul tells us: 
\f0\b it is obvious (\uc0\u948 \u8134 \u955 \u959 \u957  \'97 "it is plain/manifest") that the One who subjected all things to the Son is NOT included in the "all things."
\f2\b0 \
In other words: 
\f0\b The Father is not subjected to the Son.
\f2\b0  When we say "all things are under the Son's feet," this excludes the Father, 
\f0\b because the Father is the One who put all things under the Son.
\f2\b0  The Son's universal dominion is 
\f0\b derivative and delegated
\f2\b0  \'97 granted by the Father \'97 and the Father Himself is excepted from that dominion.\

\f0\b This single verse settles the question of Father-Son order definitively.
\f2\b0  The Father is not under the Son. The Father remains supreme. 
\f0\b The Son's exaltation does not erase the Father's prior and supreme authority.
\f2\b0 \
This perfectly preserves everything we have established:\
- The Father is the One God (Deut 6:4; Isa 44-46).\
- The Father is greater than the Son (John 14:28).\
- The Son receives all things from the Father (Matt 28:18; John 5:22-27).\
- The Father is excepted from "all things" \'97 He is the Subjecter, not the Subjected.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa360\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 Clause 8: \uc0\u8005 \u964 \u945 \u957  \u948 \u8050  \u8017 \u960 \u959 \u964 \u945 \u947 \u8135  \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u8183  \u964 \u8048  \u960 \u940 \u957 \u964 \u945 , \u964 \u972 \u964 \u949  \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u8056 \u962  \u8001  \u933 \u7985 \u8056 \u962  \u8017 \u960 \u959 \u964 \u945 \u947 \u942 \u963 \u949 \u964 \u945 \u953  \u964 \u8183  \u8017 \u960 \u959 \u964 \u940 \u958 \u945 \u957 \u964 \u953  \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u8183  \u964 \u8048  \u960 \u940 \u957 \u964 \u945  \'97 
