\f2\b0\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf0 In the eternal state:\
- 
\f0\b The Temple is the Lord God Almighty AND the Lamb
\f2\b0  \'97 two distinct figures jointly forming the place of worship.\
- 
\f0\b The glory of God
\f2\b0  illuminates the city; 
\f0\b the Lamb is its lamp.
\f2\b0  The light is the Father's glory; the Lamb is the lamp by which that glory illuminates.\
The Father remains supreme; the Lamb (the exalted Man Christ Jesus) eternally bears the Father's glory to the redeemed creation.\
