- The final word of the Son: 
\f1\i "Yea, I come quickly."
\f2\i0 \
This will be the 
\f0\b capstone
\f2\b0  of our entire study \'97 bringing every thread we have traced from Genesis 3:15 to its final unfolding in the concluding prophecy.\
Shall we now proceed to 
\f0\b (D)
\f2\b0  \'97 the Son in the Apocalypse?\
