Where I broke off, I was examining the speaker in Rev 22:12-13.\
The speaker says:\
- 
\f0\b \uc0\u7956 \u961 \u967 \u959 \u956 \u945 \u953  \u964 \u945 \u967 \u973 
\f2\b0  \'97 
\f1\i "I am coming quickly"
\f2\i0 \
- 
\f0\b \uc0\u8001  \u956 \u953 \u963 \u952 \u972 \u962  \u956 \u959 \u965  \u956 \u949 \u964 \u8125  \u7952 \u956 \u959 \u8166 
\f2\b0  \'97 
\f1\i "My reward is with Me"
\f2\i0  (echoing Isa 40:10 LXX and 62:11 LXX where the LORD comes with His reward)\
- 
\f0\b \uc0\u7952 \u947 \u8060  \u964 \u8056  \u7948 \u955 \u966 \u945  \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u964 \u8056  \u8046 , \u8001  \u960 \u961 \u8182 \u964 \u959 \u962  \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u8001  \u7956 \u963 \u967 \u945 \u964 \u959 \u962 , \u7969  \u7936 \u961 \u967 \u8052  \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u964 \u8056  \u964 \u941 \u955 \u959 \u962 
\f2\b0  \'97 
\f1\i "I am the Alpha and Omega, the First and the Last, the Beginning and the End."
