\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 Observation\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa346\partightenfactor0

\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf0 Multiple direct witnesses from Jesus' own mouth
\f2\b0  establish: 
\f0\b The Father is in the Son; the Son is in the Father.
\f2\b0  This is the 
\f0\b prototype mutual indwelling
\f2\b0  that will be extended to the redeemed in Part F.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
