\pard\pardeftab720\sa346\partightenfactor0

\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf0 This is a stunning OT parallel.
\f2\b0  Zechariah's vision contains:\
1. 
\f0\b A lampstand with seven lamps
\f2\b0  \'97 directly paralleling 
