\f0\b John in the Apocalypse is clearly drawing on Zechariah 4.
\f2\b0  The seven lamps before the throne and the seven eyes of the Lamb are 
\f0\b Zechariah's lampstand and eyes-of-the-LORD imagery taken up and applied.
