\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 Observation\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa346\partightenfactor0

\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf0 "The eyes of the LORD range through all the earth"
\f2\b0  is an OT theme. It signifies the LORD's omniscient, omnipresent observation of all things \'97 His Spirit-presence active throughout the creation. In the Apocalypse, this is now expressed as 
\f0\b the seven eyes of the Lamb
\f2\b0  \'97 meaning 
\f0\b the Father's omniscient, omnipresent Spirit-vision is now exercised through the Son.
\f2\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
