\f2\b0  \'97 
\f1\i "the Spirit of God dwells in you."
\f2\i0  The verb 
\f0\b \uc0\u959 \u7984 \u954 \u949 \u8150 
\f2\b0  \'97 
\f1\i "dwells, makes home"
\f2\i0  \'97 denotes 
\f0\b permanent residence.
