\f0\b (2)
\f2\b0  Paul shifts between 
\f0\b "Spirit of God,"
\f2\b0  
\f0\b "Spirit of Christ,"
\f2\b0  
\f0\b "Christ in you,"
\f2\b0  and 
\f0\b "the Spirit of Him who raised Jesus."
