\f0\b the same indwelling reality
\f2\b0  described from different angles \'97 confirming what we noted: 
\f0\b the Spirit is the Father's own Spirit
\f2\b0 , given through the exalted Son, identical with 
\f0\b Christ in you
\f2\b0 , because the Father (Spirit) and the Son are united and indwell believers as one.\

