\f2\b0  
\f0\b \uc0\u964 \u959 \u8166  \u7952 \u957 \u959 \u953 \u954 \u959 \u8166 \u957 \u964 \u959 \u962  \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u928 \u957 \u949 \u973 \u956 \u945 \u964 \u959 \u962  \u7952 \u957  \u8017 \u956 \u8150 \u957 
\f2\b0  \'97 
\f1\i "His Spirit that dwells in you."
\f2\i0  The participle 
\f0\b \uc0\u7952 \u957 \u959 \u953 \u954 \u959 \u8166 \u957 \u964 \u959 \u962 
\f2\b0  ("indwelling") underscores the permanence and the internal nature of the residence.\
