\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 John 17:11 \'97 The Father's Name Given to the Son:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa346\partightenfactor0

\f1\i\b0\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf0 "...\uc0\u928 \u940 \u964 \u949 \u961  \u7941 \u947 \u953 \u949 , \u964 \u942 \u961 \u951 \u963 \u959 \u957  \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u959 \u8058 \u962  \u7952 \u957  \u964 \u8183  \u8000 \u957 \u972 \u956 \u945 \u964 \u943  \u963 \u959 \u965  \u8103  \u948 \u941 \u948 \u969 \u954 \u940 \u962  \u956 \u959 \u953 , \u7989 \u957 \u945  \u8038 \u963 \u953 \u957  \u7955 \u957  \u954 \u945 \u952 \u8060 \u962  \u7969 \u956 \u949 \u8150 \u962 ."
