\f0\b \uc0\u947 \u957 \u969 \u961 \u943 \u963 \u969 
\f2\b0  \'97 future \'97 
\f1\i "I will make known"
\f2\i0  (the continuing work after His glorification, through the Spirit).\

\f0\b The Son's declaration of the Father's Name is both completed and ongoing.
\f2\b0  What He has done in His earthly ministry, He continues to do through the indwelling Spirit. The Spirit's work is to keep declaring the Father's Name to the believers' hearts \'97 leading them into ever-deeper knowledge of the Father.\
