\pard\pardeftab720\sa346\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf0 Is there any thread of this study you wish to revisit, deepen, or pursue further? Any passage you wish to examine more carefully? Any question that has emerged in your mind as we have walked through these things together?\
The Word is inexhaustible. We have surveyed a great deal \'97 but there is always more to behold of the Father in His Beloved Son.\
