\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 Observations of foundational importance\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa346\partightenfactor0

\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf0 (1) The believer is adopted by the Father
\f2\b0  \'97 receiving the Spirit of adoption.\

\f0\b (2) The believer cries "Abba, Father"
\f2\b0  \'97 using the very intimate address Jesus used in Gethsemane (Mark 14:36). The Son's relationship to the Father becomes the believer's relationship.\

\f0\b (3) The believer is a child of God \'97 and therefore an heir.
\f2\b0 \

\f0\b (4) Heirs of God, joint-heirs with Christ
\f2\b0  (\uc0\u963 \u965 \u947 \u954 \u955 \u951 \u961 \u959 \u957 \u972 \u956 \u959 \u953 ). What the Son inherits, we inherit 
\f1\i with
\f2\i0  Him. Not separately, but 
\f0\b jointly.
\f2\b0 \

\f0\b (5) The condition: \uc0\u949 \u7988 \u960 \u949 \u961  \u963 \u965 \u956 \u960 \u940 \u963 \u967 \u959 \u956 \u949 \u957  \u7989 \u957 \u945  \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u963 \u965 \u957 \u948 \u959 \u958 \u945 \u963 \u952 \u8182 \u956 \u949 \u957 
\f2\b0  \'97 
\f1\i "if indeed we suffer together, that we may also be glorified together."
\f2\i0 \
The "
\f0\b together
\f2\b0 " prefixes pile up: 
\f0\b co-suffer, co-glorified.
\f2\b0  As we share in His sufferings, so we shall share in His glory.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa331\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs40 \cf0 POINT 11 \'97 CONFORMED TO THE IMAGE OF THE SON\
