\fs36 \cf0 Romans 8:29:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa346\partightenfactor0

\f1\i\b0\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf0 "For those which he knew before, he also predestinate 
\f2\i0 (predestinated)
\f1\i  to be made like to the image of his Son, that he might be the first born among many brethren."
\f2\i0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa360\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 2 Corinthians 3:18:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa346\partightenfactor0

\f1\i\b0\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf0 "But we all behold as in a mirror the glory of the Lord with open face, and are changed into the same image, from glory to glory, as by the Spirit of the Lord."
