\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 Observation\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa346\partightenfactor0

\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf0 The believer is being conformed to the image of the Son.
\f2\b0  This is the Father's predestined purpose. We who were in Adam's fallen image are being remade in the Son's glorious image \'97 
\f0\b from glory to glory
\f2\b0  \'97 by the Spirit.\
The Son is the 
\f0\b \uc0\u960 \u961 \u969 \u964 \u972 \u964 \u959 \u954 \u959 \u962  \u7952 \u957  \u960 \u959 \u955 \u955 \u959 \u8150 \u962  \u7936 \u948 \u949 \u955 \u966 \u959 \u8150 \u962 
\f2\b0  \'97 
\f1\i "the firstborn among many brethren."
\f2\i0  He is the prototype; we are being conformed to His pattern. He has many brethren \'97 and we are among them.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa331\partightenfactor0

