\pard\pardeftab720\sa360\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 Romans 8:17 \'97 already cited: 
\f3\i "if so be that we suffer with him, that we may be also glorified together."
\f0\i0 \
1 Peter 4:13:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa346\partightenfactor0

\f1\i\b0\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf0 "But rejoice, inasmuch as ye are partakers of Christ's sufferings, that when his glory shall appear, ye may be glad and rejoice."
