\pard\pardeftab720\sa360\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 Observation\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa346\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf0 The believer shares 
\f0\b the fellowship of Christ's sufferings
\f2\b0  (\uc0\u954 \u959 \u953 \u957 \u969 \u957 \u943 \u945  \u964 \u8182 \u957  \u960 \u945 \u952 \u951 \u956 \u940 \u964 \u969 \u957  \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u959 \u8166 ). Not that we contribute to atonement (Christ's suffering was once-for-all), but that we participate in the kind of suffering He endured \'97 opposition, rejection, persecution, the cross-bearing life \'97 
\f0\b in fellowship with Him.
\f2\b0 \
And this fellowship in suffering is the gateway to 
\f0\b fellowship in glory.
\f2\b0  What the Son endured, He endured 
\f0\b for us
\f2\b0 ; what we endure, we endure 
\f0\b with Him
\f2\b0 .\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
