\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 Observation\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa346\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf0 The final identification: when the Son appears in glory, 
\f0\b we appear with Him in glory.
\f2\b0  We shall be 
\f0\b like Him
\f2\b0  \'97 for we shall see Him as He is. And 
\f0\b we shall ever be with the Lord.
\f2\b0 \
This is the consummation of identification: from co-crucifixion to co-glorification, from being hidden with Christ in God to being manifested with Him in glory. The entire arc is one continuous identification.\
