\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 1599 Geneva:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa346\partightenfactor0

\f1\i\b0\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf0 "So they departed from the council, rejoicing, that they were counted worthy to suffer rebuke for his Name."
