\pard\pardeftab720\sa346\partightenfactor0

\f1\i\b0\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf0 "If ye be railed upon for the Name of Christ, blessed are ye: for the spirit of glory, and of God resteth upon you... But if any man suffer as a Christian, let him not be ashamed: but let him glorify God in this behalf."
