\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 Observation\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa346\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf0 Paul cites Psalm 43:23 LXX (44:22 MT) \'97 the psalmist's lament that God's people are slaughtered all day long for His sake. 
