\f0\b\fs40 \cf0 CATEGORY 4 \'97 SUFFERING THROUGH THE GROANINGS OF THE FALLEN CREATION\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa346\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf0 A different facet again: the suffering that comes simply from being part of a creation under bondage to corruption \'97 yet borne with hope.\
