\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 Observations\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa346\partightenfactor0

\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf0 (1)
\f2\b0  
\f0\b \uc0\u964 \u8048  \u960 \u945 \u952 \u942 \u956 \u945 \u964 \u945  \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u957 \u8166 \u957  \u954 \u945 \u953 \u961 \u959 \u8166 
\f2\b0  \'97 
\f1\i "the sufferings of the present time."
\f2\i0  Paul speaks of an entire era of suffering \'97 
\f1\i this present age
\f2\i0  until the Son's appearing.\

\f0\b (2)
\f2\b0  
\f0\b \uc0\u960 \u8118 \u963 \u945  \u7969  \u954 \u964 \u943 \u963 \u953 \u962  \u963 \u965 \u963 \u964 \u949 \u957 \u940 \u950 \u949 \u953  \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u963 \u965 \u957 \u969 \u948 \u943 \u957 \u949 \u953 
\f2\b0  \'97 
\f1\i "the whole creation groans together and travails in pain together."
\f2\i0  The entire creation suffers \'97 under the curse of Genesis 3. The believer is not exempt from the conditions of the cursed creation.\

\f0\b (3)
\f2\b0  
\f0\b \uc0\u954 \u945 \u8054  \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u959 \u8054  \u7952 \u957  \u7953 \u945 \u965 \u964 \u959 \u8150 \u962  \u963 \u964 \u949 \u957 \u940 \u950 \u959 \u956 \u949 \u957 
\f2\b0  \'97 
\f1\i "we ourselves also groan within ourselves."
\f2\i0  The believer groans \'97 even possessing the firstfruits of the Spirit \'97 awaiting the full redemption (the resurrection of the body).\

\f0\b (4)
\f2\b0  
\f0\b The disease, decay, weakness, frailty, and mortality of our bodies are part of this suffering.
\f2\b0  We were redeemed; our spirits were sealed; but our bodies still bear the corruption of Adam's race, awaiting the 
\f0\b \uc0\u7936 \u960 \u959 \u955 \u973 \u964 \u961 \u969 \u963 \u953 \u962  \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u963 \u974 \u956 \u945 \u964 \u959 \u962 
\f2\b0  \'97 
\f1\i the redemption of the body
\f2\i0  (Rom 8:23) \'97 which comes at His appearing.\

\f0\b (5)
\f2\b0  This is a 
\f0\b groaning with hope
\f2\b0  \'97 not despair. The sufferings are 
\f0\b \uc0\u959 \u8016 \u954  \u7940 \u958 \u953 \u945 
\f2\b0  \'97 
\f1\i not worthy
\f2\i0  \'97 to be compared with the coming glory.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa331\partightenfactor0

