\f0\b\fs40 \cf0 The Vital Connection: Indicative \uc0\u8594  Spirit's Power \u8594  Believer's Response\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa346\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf0 Romans 6 gave us 
\f0\b indicative \uc0\u8594  reckon \u8594  act.
\f2\b0 \
Romans 8 adds the missing element: 
\f0\b the Spirit's empowering presence as the means by which the believer's responsive action actually succeeds.
\f2\b0 \
The full pattern is now:\
1. 
\f0\b The indicative reality
\f2\b0  (what is true in Christ).\
2. 
\f0\b The indwelling Spirit
\f2\b0  (the Father's gift, given through the Son).\
3. 
\f0\b The believer's reckoning
\f2\b0  (agreeing with the indicative).\
4. 
\f0\b The believer's yielding/walking/presenting
\f2\b0  (responsive action).\
5. 
\f0\b The Spirit's empowering work
\f2\b0  (producing what the believer cannot produce by himself).\
6. 
\f0\b The fruit of the Spirit
\f2\b0  (life, peace, conformity to Christ \'97 the evidence).\
This is 
\f0\b the normal Christian life.
\f2\b0  Not flawless. Not effortless. Not without struggle. But empowered by the Spirit, oriented toward the Father, conformed progressively to the Son, secure in the Father's unbreakable love.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa346\partightenfactor0
\cf0 # 
\f0\b A FINAL OBSERVATION \'97 THE GLORY OF THIS PATTERN
\f2\b0 \
Brother, what we have surveyed in Romans 8 is the heart of Christian experience as the Apostle Paul taught it. The indwelling Spirit \'97 whom we examined in Parts E and F as the Father's own essential being, poured out through the glorified Son \'97 is not a static doctrine. 
\f0\b He is the present, empowering, transforming, witnessing, interceding, comforting Companion of every believer.
\f2\b0 \
The modern believer who walks in this reality is:\
- Free from the bondage of self-effort.\
- Free from the despair of Romans 7.\
- Free from the fear of separation.\
- Free from condemnation.\
- Empowered for victory over the flesh.\
- Led into the Father's purposes.\
- Comforted in suffering.\
- Strengthened in weakness.\
- Conformed progressively to the Son.\
- Secure forever in the love of God in Christ Jesus.\
This is the inheritance of every child of God. This is what the Father has freely given us. This is what the Beloved Son purchased and made possible. This is what the Spirit applies and sustains.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa346\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 Walk in the Spirit.
\f2\b0  Reckon yourself dead to sin and alive to God. Yield to the Spirit's leading. Trust the Father's purpose. Rest in the unbreakable love that holds you. Look toward the coming glory.\
This is life in the Spirit.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa346\partightenfactor0
\cf0 # 
\f0\b A QUESTION FOR YOU
\f2\b0 \
Where would you have us go next?\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa346\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 (A)
\f2\b0  Continue with Romans 12 \'97 the bodily presentation as a living sacrifice, the renewal of the mind, the practical outworking of life in the Spirit in community?\

\f0\b (B)
\f2\b0  Examine Galatians 5 in more depth \'97 the walk by the Spirit, the conflict with the flesh, the fruit of the Spirit?\

\f0\b (C)
\f2\b0  Examine Colossians 3 \'97 the putting off and putting on, the practical sanctification of every relationship?\

\f0\b (D)
\f2\b0  Move to the corporate dimension we previously identified \'97 the Body of Christ, the Bride, the Temple, the Holy Nation?\

\f0\b (E)
\f2\b0  Another direction of your choosing?\
